# THE TREAD'S PEOPLE'S HOLDING (GenTreads.dress `_holding`, #27): Tull on his lip
# of the crater the walker lead pins (`the_tread`), and round him what they keep
# there: a shack out past the lip turned to the crater, a fire and a bench to one
# side of the line out, so his own spot stays open. From above at noon, then over
# his shoulder, then at dusk with the fire the only warm light on the rim.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/tread-holding.tour --seed=1 --hour=12 --weather=clear:0
at cast:tull
wait 3
shot 01-tull-and-the-holding-from-above
hold shoulder
wait 1.5
shot 02-over-his-shoulder-the-shack-fire-and-bench
release shoulder
wait 1
hour 20
wait 3
shot 03-the-holding-at-dusk
